      "created_at": "2012-12-31T18:16:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey everyone! I'm faily new to Sentinels of the Multiverse. I have tons of fun playing the game and would liek to get to know the characters more. I saw that the comic book is avialable on this website. I was wondering if the online comics would be out in print form. It's very difficult for me to be on the computer all the time. I rather just print and take it with me on the road. Does anyone know if these comics are or will be available to print in PDF form? I wouldn't even mind buying the comics at my local game store. I just wish it was available to those of us that don't live on the computer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks,</p><p>Barby</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
